{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.poster.avif?t=1767563308\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.webm?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.mp4?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully illustrated world in <strong>Pigeon Hunter</strong>, a tranquil hidden object game. Each room is a hand-drawn work of art, filled with carefully placed objects which, as the player you must find to complete the level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the relaxing gameplay as you search for cleverly hidden objects and journey through the rooms and courtyard of a dreamlike dwelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.poster.avif?t=1767563308\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.webm?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.mp4?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn 2d backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100s of pigeons to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional non pigeon based objects (such as snails and keys) to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple scenes to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing classical music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/53974e56796f28354078b87a76bf1176.poster.avif?t=1767563308\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/53974e56796f28354078b87a76bf1176.webm?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/53974e56796f28354078b87a76bf1176.mp4?t=1767563308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The playtest is here!</strong> Your feedback is incredibly valuable. Please play the demo and add <strong>Pigeon Hunter</strong> to your wishlist to support its development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917020?t=1767563308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/bc24bf144c4afe17ecde36ebd59e3ad5c3366846/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767563308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/e4d70c18f376220b668e99f1c1ad6d08e754b8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767563308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/e4d70c18f376220b668e99f1c1ad6d08e754b8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767563308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos"